## Execution and assessment contract

Every ready lesson supplies explanations, steps, worked/support tasks, two distinct immediate and two delayed full checks with keys, rubrics, condition limits and fresh narrow corrections. Each full check covers the entire capability; every allowed acquisition route therefore assesses all components. Delayed retrieval requires a fresh item and at least 24 actual elapsed hours under its explicit exposure rule. Teach records evidence; recall alone chooses due dates. Neither confidence nor plan readiness establishes learner mastery.

## Revisions and evidence compatibility

P003/V002/ingestion2 adds the Week2 objectives and note/asset fingerprints. O001–O008 retain their actual revisions and criterion definitions. Week1 academic note bytes are unchanged; the hub adds Week2 relationships only. Each unchanged objective carries explicit exact compatible old tuples from P001 plus its actual P002 tuple, with justification. New objectives have no compatible old evidence. No IDs were retired, split or recycled; no existing answer was regraded and no new learner outcome or reassessment completion was fabricated.

The complete replaced P002 plan, manifest and lessons are stored byte-for-byte in [[03_Agents/2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Financial_Markets_Instruments_I/curriculum_history/P002/learning_plan.md]] and [[03_Agents/2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Financial_Markets_Instruments_I/curriculum_history/P002/source_manifest.md]], with every former lesson in the same archive. Older P001 history and all owner transaction journals remain immutable.

## Validation and readiness

The active metadata tuple is PLAN-20261009-FMI-P003 / P003 / V002 / ingestion2. Academic provenance comes from the linked independently checked ingestion. Curriculum review must verify final prompts/keys, all routes, dependencies, boundaries and history before integration; its actual result is recorded in the recovery session. After records.py atomic commit, verify this journal against active plan, manifest and every ready indexed lesson; state must remain complete at revision2 with no pending transaction or lock. A draft or header alone does not confirm a commit.

## Handoffs and remaining boundaries

Teach may execute the requested ready objective using its indexed lesson after freshness/journal checks. Academic contradictions return to ingest; missing prepared alternatives/keys return to plan. Recall consumes actual committed learner evidence and exact compatibility mappings, with answer-free labels only. Later option/pricing chapters, external videos and legal/broker claims remain outside supported ingestion. Exactly50 overall assessment points and live timetable details remain unresolved course-team context. Week2 source examples are hypothetical; interest-rate timing/day-count, bond conversion-factor170/171 and printed repo-return discrepancies stay explicit. Prepared tasks use declared consistent inputs, not the erroneous arithmetic or universal market claims.
